WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:10.733
Question five, another number series!

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:12.933
One hundred, ninety-two,

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:16.400
eighty-four, seventy-six, and then...

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.733
what? A, seventy...

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.167
B, sixty-eight... C,

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:23.367
sixty-six... or D,

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:26.133
seventy-two? Five seconds!

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:34.200
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.867
The answer is...

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:38.867
B, sixty-eight! Every step drops

00:00:38.867 --> 00:00:41.200
by eight, and seventy-six minus

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.067
eight is sixty-eight!

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:46.500
Question eight, a word analogy!

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.167
Painter is to brush,

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:50.300
as carpenter is to...

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:52.433
what? A, hammer...

00:00:52.433 --> 00:00:54.867
B, wood... C,

00:00:54.867 --> 00:00:56.733
house... or D,

00:00:56.733 --> 00:00:58.733
nail? Five seconds!

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:06.767
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:08.967
It's... A, hammer!

00:01:08.967 --> 00:01:11.100
A painter's tool is a brush,

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.833
and a carpenter's tool is a

00:01:12.833 --> 00:01:15.733
hammer. Wood is just the material,

00:01:15.733 --> 00:01:18.300
and a house is what you build!

00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:21.667
Question twelve, fill in the blank!

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:23.333
The bridge was too weak to

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.567
hold the heavy truck,

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:26.467
so workers had to blank it

00:01:26.467 --> 00:01:28.033
before opening the road.

00:01:28.033 --> 00:01:30.267
A, decorate... B,

00:01:30.267 --> 00:01:33.033
reinforce... C, rename...

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:34.667
or D, measure?

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:36.000
Five seconds!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.033
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:01:44.433 --> 00:01:47.200
It's... B, reinforce!

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.800
Too weak means you have to

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:49.933
make it stronger,

00:01:49.933 --> 00:01:52.233
and reinforce is the only word

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:54.033
that fixes the problem!

00:01:54.967 --> 00:01:57.900
So, are you smart or fart?

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.667
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:01.300
find your rank!

00:02:02.233 --> 00:02:03.733
So, how did you do?

00:02:03.733 --> 00:02:05.167
Comment your score below,

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:06.833
and follow for more!
